      <!-- ═══ API REFERENCE ═══ -->
      <section id="api" class="doc-section">
        <span class="doc-label">BACKEND</span>
        <h1 class="doc-h1">API Reference</h1>
        <p class="doc-intro">All API routes are server-side Node.js endpoints at <code>/api/*</code>. Rate limited at 60 requests/minute per IP for API routes, 120/15min for search.</p>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Search & Discovery</h2>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-get">GET</div>
          <code>/api/search?q={"<query>"}&limit={"<n>"}</code>
          <p>Full-text game search. Primary: Meilisearch fuzzy. Fallback: Supabase ilike. Returns name, slug, images, genres, Metacritic, Deck compatibility. Cached 2min.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-get">GET</div>
          <code>/api/games-search</code>
          <p>Alternative games search endpoint with similar functionality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-get">GET</div>
          <code>/api/devices-list</code>
          <p>Returns all active devices with specs (cached).</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Performance Data</h2>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-get">GET</div>
          <code>/api/consensus</code>
          <p>Fetch consensus ratings for game+device combos. Returns FPS averages, verdict, report counts, weighted scores, recommended profiles.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-get">GET</div>
          <code>/api/reports</code>
          <p>Fetch performance reports with filters (game, device, preset, rating). Supports sorting and pagination.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-post">POST</div>
          <code>/api/reports</code>
          <p>Submit a performance report. Auth optional (email required if anonymous). Fields: game, device, FPS, TDP, battery, settings, notes, rating. Triggers consensus recalculation.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Voting</h2>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-post">POST</div>
          <code>/api/votes</code>
          <p>Vote on performance reports. Auth required. Body: <code>{"{ reportId, isUpvote }"}</code>. Toggles/adds/changes vote. Rate limit: 60/15min.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Comments</h2>
        <div class="doc-endpoint">
          <div class="doc-method doc-method-get">GET</div>
          <code>/api/comments?gameId=&lt;id&gt;</code>
