      <!-- ═══ AUTH ═══ -->
      <section id="auth" class="doc-section">
        <span class="doc-label">SECURITY</span>
        <h1 class="doc-h1">Authentication</h1>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Auth Methods</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li><strong>Email/Password</strong> — standard registration with display name. Password stored in Supabase Auth (bcrypt).</li>
          <li><strong>Google OAuth</strong> — social sign-in via Supabase OAuth flow. Callback at <code>/auth/callback/google</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Anonymous</strong> — performance reports can be submitted without an account (email required for contact).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Session Management</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li>Cookie-based sessions via Supabase JWT tokens</li>
          <li>Middleware reads token from cookies on every request</li>
          <li>User object available to all pages via <code>Astro.locals</code></li>
          <li>Protected pages redirect to <code>/auth/login?redirect=&lt;current_url&gt;</code></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Authorization Levels</h2>
        <table class="doc-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Access</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Anonymous</td><td>Browse all pages, submit reports (with email), read comments</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Authenticated</td><td>Vote on reports, post comments, follow games, manage profile, import Steam library</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Verified Tester</td><td>Higher quality tier on reports, verified badge</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Moderator</td><td>Approve/reject reports and comments</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Admin</td><td>Full access: manage users, devices, articles, all moderation</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Security Headers (Middleware)</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li><code>X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff</code></li>
          <li><code>X-Frame-Options: DENY</code></li>
          <li><code>X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block</code></li>
          <li><code>Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin</code></li>
          <li><code>Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()</code></li>
          <li><code>Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000</code> (via Nginx)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ SEARCH ═══ -->
      <section id="search" class="doc-section">
        <span class="doc-label">FEATURE</span>
        <h1 class="doc-h1">Search System</h1>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Architecture</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li><strong>Primary</strong>: Meilisearch — fuzzy full-text search with typo tolerance</li>
          <li><strong>Fallback</strong>: Supabase <code>ilike</code> query — reliable but exact</li>
          <li><strong>Index</strong>: Games are indexed with name, genres, developers, tags</li>
          <li><strong>Reindex</strong>: Cron job <code>cron-reindex-meilisearch.ts</code> runs periodically</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">SearchBar Component</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li>200ms debounce on input</li>
          <li>Dropdown shows top results with game art, genres, Metacritic score, Deck badge</li>
          <li>Keyboard navigation: arrow keys to navigate, Enter to select, Esc to close</li>
          <li>Global shortcut: <code>Ctrl+K</code> or <code>/</code> to focus</li>
          <li>"View all" link to <code>/games?q={"<query>"}</code></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ CONSENSUS ═══ -->
      <section id="consensus" class="doc-section">
        <span class="doc-label">ALGORITHM</span>
        <h1 class="doc-h1">Consensus Algorithm</h1>

        <p class="doc-intro">The consensus algorithm aggregates all performance reports for a game+device pair into a single set of recommended settings and expected performance metrics.</p>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Weighting Factors</h2>
        <table class="doc-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Factor</th><th>Weight</th><th>Logic</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Quality Tier</td><td>0.3-5.0x</td><td>verified (5.0) &gt; community (3.0) &gt; reported (1.0) &gt; ai (0.5) &gt; imported (0.3)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Recency</td><td>exponential decay</td><td>90-day half-life — newer reports weigh more</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Community Votes</td><td>variable</td><td>(upvotes + 1) / (upvotes + downvotes + 2) — Wilson score approximation</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Calculation Method</h2>
        <ol class="doc-list">
          <li>Collect all approved reports for a game+device pair</li>
          <li>Apply quality × recency × vote weights to each report</li>
          <li>Calculate weighted median for FPS (avg + low), TDP, battery, thermal</li>
          <li>Calculate weighted mode for preset, resolution, FSR settings</li>
          <li>Determine overall verdict from weighted FPS median</li>
          <li>Build TDP profile (recommended settings object)</li>
          <li>Assign confidence level: low (&lt;3 reports), medium (3-10), high (&gt;10)</li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Verdict Thresholds</h2>
        <table class="doc-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Verdict</th><th>FPS Threshold</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Excellent</td><td>&ge;60 FPS</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Good</td><td>&ge;40 FPS</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Fair</td><td>&ge;30 FPS</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Poor</td><td>&ge;20 FPS</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Unplayable</td><td>&lt;20 FPS</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">TDP Profile Structure</h2>
        <div class="doc-code">
          <pre set:html={`interface TDPProfile {\n  tdpWatts: number;       // Recommended TDP in watts\n  gpuClockMhz?: number;   // GPU clock speed\n  fpsTarget: number;       // Target FPS\n  fpsAvg: number;          // Expected average FPS\n  resolution: string;      // "1280x800"\n  preset: string;          // "high", "ultra", etc.\n  fsrEnabled: boolean;     // AMD FSR upscaling\n  fsrMode?: string;        // quality/balanced/performance\n  estimatedBatteryHours: number;\n  thermal: string;         // cool/warm/hot\n  fanNoise: string;        // silent/quiet/audible/loud\n  keySettings?: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;\n  reportCount: number;\n  confidence: string;      // low/medium/high\n}`} />
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ CRON JOBS ═══ -->
      <section id="cron" class="doc-section">
        <span class="doc-label">AUTOMATION</span>
        <h1 class="doc-h1">Cron Jobs & Scripts</h1>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Scheduled Tasks</h2>
        <table class="doc-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Script</th><th>Schedule</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>cron-consensus.ts</code></td><td>Every 12h</td><td>Recalculate consensus ratings for all game+device pairs with 1+ reports</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-award-badges.ts</code></td><td>Daily</td><td>Calculate and award achievement badges to qualifying users</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-sync-steam.ts</code></td><td>Daily</td><td>Sync game metadata from Steam (prices, reviews, descriptions)</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-sync-protondb.ts</code></td><td>Daily</td><td>Update Proton compatibility tiers</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-enrich-games.ts</code></td><td>Daily</td><td>Fetch missing IGDB/HLTB data for games</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-ingest-news.ts</code></td><td>Hourly</td><td>Fetch RSS feeds from gaming news sources</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-generate-articles.ts</code></td><td>On demand</td><td>AI-generated editorial articles using Claude</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-import-top-games.ts</code></td><td>Daily</td><td>Import Steam Top Played games with quality gate</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-youtube-import.ts</code></td><td>On demand</td><td>Import performance data from YouTube video transcripts</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>cron-reindex-meilisearch.ts</code></td><td>Daily</td><td>Full reindex of games into Meilisearch</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Data Management Scripts</h2>
        <table class="doc-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Script</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>seed-devices.ts</code></td><td>Initialize device catalog (Steam Deck, ROG Ally, etc.)</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>seed-badges.ts</code></td><td>Create achievement badge definitions</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>seed-games-steam.ts</code></td><td>Import top Steam games</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>seed-initial-news.ts</code></td><td>Initial editorial articles</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>clean-fake-data.ts</code></td><td>Remove test/fake performance data</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>clean-junk-games.ts</code></td><td>Purge low-quality game entries</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>analyze-coverage.ts</code></td><td>Report coverage analysis</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>backup-db.sh</code></td><td>Database backup (pg_dump)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ INFRASTRUCTURE ═══ -->
      <section id="infrastructure" class="doc-section">
        <span class="doc-label">DEVOPS</span>
        <h1 class="doc-h1">Infrastructure</h1>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Server</h2>
        <table class="doc-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Hosting</td><td>OVH VPS (Ubuntu 22.04, Linux 6.8)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Domain</td><td>handhelddb.com (Cloudflare DNS)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Web Server</td><td>Nginx 1.x — SSL termination, proxy cache, static files</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Application</td><td>Node.js 22 — Astro SSR on port 4321</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Process Manager</td><td>systemd (<code>handhelddb.service</code>)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>SSL</td><td>Let's Encrypt via Certbot (auto-renewed)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Nginx Configuration</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li><strong>Upstream</strong>: <code>127.0.0.1:4321</code> with keepalive pool (8 connections)</li>
          <li><strong>Proxy cache</strong>: 10MB keys zone, 500MB max, 1h inactive TTL, 5min valid for 200 responses</li>
          <li><strong>Static assets</strong>: <code>/_astro/*</code> served from disk with <code>Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable</code></li>
          <li><strong>Gzip</strong>: Level 6 compression for text/CSS/JS/JSON/XML/SVG (min 1000 bytes)</li>
          <li><strong>Redirects</strong>: www → non-www, HTTP → HTTPS, old VPS hostname → domain</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">systemd Service</h2>
        <div class="doc-code">
          <pre>User=ubuntu
WorkingDirectory=/home/ubuntu/handhelddb
ExecStart=/usr/bin/node dist/server/entry.mjs
Restart=always (3s delay)
Security: NoNewPrivileges, PrivateTmp, ProtectKernelTunables</pre>
        </div>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Deployment Pipeline</h2>
        <ol class="doc-list">
          <li><code>npx astro build</code> — generates <code>dist/server/</code> (SSR) + <code>dist/client/</code> (static)</li>
          <li><code>sudo systemctl restart handhelddb</code> — restart the Node.js process</li>
          <li>Nginx picks up new static files immediately (hashed filenames)</li>
          <li>Proxy cache auto-expires within 5 minutes</li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Caching Strategy</h2>
        <table class="doc-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>TTL</th><th>Scope</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Application (in-memory)</td><td>2-10 min</td><td>Homepage (2m), games (5m), devices (10m)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Nginx proxy cache</td><td>5 min</td><td>All SSR responses (bypassed with cookies)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Static assets</td><td>1 year</td><td><code>/_astro/*</code> — content-hashed, immutable</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Browser</td><td>Varies</td><td>Standard HTTP cache headers</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <!-- ═══ SEO ═══ -->
      <section id="seo" class="doc-section">
        <span class="doc-label">OPTIMIZATION</span>
        <h1 class="doc-h1">SEO & Performance</h1>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">SEO Features</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li><strong>Structured data</strong>: Schema.org JSON-LD for WebSite (search action), VideoGame (game pages), BreadcrumbList, Product (devices)</li>
          <li><strong>Open Graph</strong>: Title, description, custom OG images per game (<code>/api/og/[slug]</code>)</li>
          <li><strong>Twitter Cards</strong>: summary_large_image with custom images</li>
          <li><strong>Canonical URLs</strong>: Every page has <code>&lt;link rel="canonical"&gt;</code></li>
          <li><strong>Sitemap</strong>: Dynamic XML sitemap at <code>/sitemap.xml</code></li>
          <li><strong>RSS</strong>: Article feed at <code>/rss.xml</code></li>
          <li><strong>robots.txt</strong>: Dynamic generation</li>
          <li><strong>View Transitions</strong>: Astro native cross-fade between pages</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Performance Optimizations</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li><strong>Server-side rendering</strong>: Full HTML delivered on first request — no blank page/spinner</li>
          <li><strong>Island architecture</strong>: Only interactive components load JavaScript (React islands)</li>
          <li><strong>Lazy hydration</strong>: <code>client:visible</code> defers component loading until in viewport</li>
          <li><strong>Image optimization</strong>: Steam CDN images with <code>loading="lazy"</code></li>
          <li><strong>Gzip compression</strong>: Nginx compresses all text-based responses</li>
          <li><strong>Immutable static assets</strong>: Content-hashed filenames with 1-year cache</li>
          <li><strong>Font preloading</strong>: Google Fonts with <code>preconnect</code></li>
          <li><strong>Reduced motion</strong>: Animations respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="doc-h2">Accessibility</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li>Skip-to-content link</li>
          <li>Keyboard navigation on search (arrow keys, Esc)</li>
          <li>ARIA labels on interactive elements (buttons, links, modals)</li>
          <li>Color contrast meets WCAG guidelines</li>
          <li>Semantic HTML (nav, main, section, article)</li>
          <li>Focus indicators on interactive elements</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <footer class="doc-footer">
